                                                                    <P><A HREF="./uss_cyclops_vanishes--_a_passa.html">USS <I>Cyclops</I>  </A> &nbsp;  <IMG ID="Rectangle22" HEIGHT=14 WIDTH=4 SRC="./assets/images/autogen/a_Rectangle_64.gif" VSPACE=0 HSPACE=0 ALIGN="TOP" BORDER=0 ALT=""> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <A HREF="./the__lost_patrol__--_flight_19.html">Flight 19 </A> &nbsp; &nbsp; <IMG ID="Rectangle21" HEIGHT=14 WIDTH=4 SRC="./assets/images/autogen/a_Rectangle_64.gif" VSPACE=0 HSPACE=0 ALIGN="TOP" BORDER=0 ALT=""> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <A HREF="./html/introduction_to_the_bermuda_tr.html">Bermuda Triangle Index</A></P>
